\">close</span></div><!----></div></div><!----></app-jss-saudia-general-tablayout><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n<hr>\n<div class=\"custom-content__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/pages/lounge-pass/loung-pass-2.ashx?rev=e2f8e222cde84198918f1649b2bbba16&amp;hash=C9D4AA5762A2517B42A014A3749DB61E\">\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<p>Saudia lounges are thoughtfully designed to offer a range of amenities that will make your journey as enjoyable as possible.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/pages/lounge-pass/loung-pass-1.ashx?rev=04abe01b917548e79557cdc08874b2a7&amp;hash=5C6E51B6A90D69D718094DBD9D234F9B\">\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<p>Beyond premium lounges, explore a world of exclusive advantages. Refuel, relax and unwind with a variety of additional benefits to enhance your experience.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/pages/lounge-pass/loung-pass-3.ashx?rev=1794530c045e4bc99ead888b90ba6466&amp;hash=48F30EAEB51BBE8274EE917B7E55C5DA\">\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<p>Guests travelling economy class can enjoy Alfursan paid access to our lounges in Jeddah, Riyadh and Cairo.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\"><!--<br class=\"t-last-br\" />-->\n\n<h2>Our Locations</h2>\n<table role=\"table\" aria-label=\"Our locations\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\">Location (Departure Airport)</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Total Price</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\" rowspan=\"2\">Jeddah</th>\n            <td data-label=\"Location\">Domestic flights</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Total Price\">166.75 SAR</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td data-label=\"Location\">International flights</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Total Price\">345 SAR</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Cairo</th>\n            <td data-label=\"Location\">International</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Total Price\">182 SAR</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-tabs class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-tab-container\"><mat-tab-group animationduration=\"0ms\" class=\"mat-tab-group mat-primary ng-star-inserted\"><mat-tab-header class=\"mat-tab-header\"><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-before mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button><div class=\"mat-tab-label-container\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"mat-tab-list\"><div class=\"mat-tab-labels\"><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator mat-tab-label-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-1-0\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-posinset=\"1\" aria-setsize=\"1\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-1-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Terms and Conditions<!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----></div><mat-ink-bar class=\"mat-ink-bar\"></mat-ink-bar></div></div><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-after mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button></mat-tab-header><div class=\"mat-tab-body-wrapper\"><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" c